### Force the execution of a pending LIMIT order (demo)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/internal/orders/5/execute
X-Role: ADMIN

### Delete an order (demo)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/internal/orders/7
X-Role: ADMIN

### Set the latest market data close price (demo)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/internal/instruments/47/market-data
X-Role: ADMIN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "close": "1000.00"
}

### Set close and previousClose (demo)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/internal/instruments/47/market-data
X-Role: ADMIN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "close": "1000.00",
  "previousClose": "950.50"
}

### Create a test user (demo)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/internal/users
X-Role: ADMIN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@test.com"
}

### Restore the seed data (demo)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/internal/reset
X-Role: ADMIN
